  "body": "Yesterday we held our weekly WHATNOT meeting and whatwg/html#10441 contains the details of that including minutes. The next one is scheduled for July 11 at a time reasonable for Europe and Asia-Pacific (or so we hope).\r\n\r\nPeople interested in attending the next call please respond here or reach out privately to @past, @cwilso, or the spec editors. We will be tagging issues for the next call again using the agenda+ label in all WHATWG repos and we would like to invite anyone that can contribute to said issues to join us.",
